# Security headers for static files (the app page, scripts, and Cesium
# assets). API responses get their headers from the Worker instead.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy starts in report-only mode: browsers report
# violations without blocking anything, so the allowed sources can be
# confirmed against real traffic before the policy is enforced.
# - script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval': Cesium decodes 3D data with WebAssembly.
# - worker-src blob: Cesium starts some web workers from in-memory code.
# - style-src 'unsafe-inline': Cesium's widgets set inline styles.
# - img-src and connect-src *.cesium.com and *.virtualearth.net: imagery
#   streamed through Cesium ion when a token is configured.
# - img-src imgproxy.windy.com and frame-src webcams.windy.com: Windy camera
#   images and timelapse players, which Windy's terms require loading from
#   Windy itself. They match the Windy source's allowed hosts on the server.
# - script-src static.cloudflareinsights.com: Cloudflare Web Analytics, which
#   the edge adds to production pages (a zone rule keeps it off staging). It
#   is cookieless and reports to our own /cdn-cgi/rum, so 'self' covers that.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.cesium.com https://*.virtualearth.net https://imgproxy.windy.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.cesium.com https://assets.ion.cesium.com https://*.virtualearth.net; font-src 'self'; frame-src https://webcams.windy.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
